cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "xbp1-junction-counter"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Gurbachan
    affiliation: "Department of Biology, University of Ottawa"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE_ME/xbp1-junction-counter"
abstract: >-
  Counts the IRE1alpha-dependent 26-nucleotide splice junction in XBP1 mRNA from
  RNA sequencing data, enumerating all seven coordinate placements rendered
  equivalent by the flanking direct repeat, reporting Wilson intervals on
  informative junction reads, and applying a power-based depth standard.
